{"slug":"civilization-survival-game-LedZ-Civ-75902","_id":"69440ca65e6c74e9c1972d93","title":"LedZ Civ V3.3","game":{"_id":"68585116ac15ee5efb80b9ce","gameId":102829972707814,"name":"[UPD] civilization survival game","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":102829972707814},"features":"I would appreciate if u join the discord, features:\n\nPlayer › Movement\n- Speed Boost (+ Speed Multiplier, Speed Jitter)\n- No Slow (kills crouch/knock/aim/stationary slowdowns)\n- Infinite Jump\n- CFrame Fly — WASD + Space/Shift (+ Fly Speed)\n- Noclip (walk through walls)\n- Ghost — stealth CFrame ground-speed (+ Ghost Speed, Ghost Stealth 1–4)\n- CFrame Speed — jittered movement on top of walking (+ amount)\n- CFrame Fly (noclip + jitter) (+ speed)\n\nPlayer › Survival\n- Infinite Water (auto-drink, direct)\n- Auto Hunger (auto-eats food)\n- Auto Prompts (+ Respect Hold Time)\n- Keep Backpack Open\n- Anti-Grab (breaks foreign carry welds)\n\nPlayer › Visuals\n- Player ESP — Names+Distance, Boxes, Health bars, Chams, Distance slider\n- Town ESP — real civ names from the town hall's Team value (+ label growth)\n- Rock ESP — Stone/Gold/Marble/Copper nodes, Map.Resources.Rocks or Direct Workspace scan (+ distance)\n- Loot ESP (dropped items) — tools-only pickups on the ground: Show Item dropdown (lists each dropped tool by name + count, or All Items), Show Distance toggle, Loot ESP Distance slider, Refresh Loot List button\n- Hitbox Expander — Show Box, Hitbox Size, Box Transparency\n\nCombat › Fight\n- Spear Silent Aim (+ Prediction, Prediction Lead, Aim Range, Team Check, Auto Throw)\n- Buttons: Throw At Nearest, Shield Up, Shield Down, Kick Shields, Toggle Friendly Fire\n- Auto Combat — Auto Kick (when they shield), Auto Shield (when they attack), range\n- Auto-Equip Strongest Weapon When Hit\n- Panic — Safe Now (rise), Auto Panic Rise (low HP), Stay Up (hover), HP Threshold, Rise Height\n\nCombat › Ghost\n- Ghost Kill (follow target; underneath = noclip under terrain, above = no-clip)\n- Go Above toggle, Visible Hitbox, Target Hitbox Radius\n\nWorld › Deploy\n- Plant Near Me\n- Plant Where I Stand — plants at your feet, air-fallback if the spot's rejected\n- Plant At Town Root — plants at the nearest town hall's center\n- Place at Mouse (click)\n- Auto-Plant Around You (+ Auto Radius) — no more town bias, air-fallback placement\n- Ring Town Hall (+ Ring Radius, Ring Count)\n\nWorld › Trader\n- Trade All Affordable (once), Auto-Trade Affordable, interval\n\nWorld › Jobs\n- Create My Own Civ\n- Join Team / Civ dropdown (+ Refresh Teams)\n- Pick Job dropdown — auto-hops to a job board (+ Refresh Job List)\n\nWorld › Misc\n- Withdraw All From Storage (empties an open chest at once)\n- Announcement Logger (rolling leader-announcement history + Clear)\n- Unload","tags":["OP","keyless","civ","free"],"script":"-- join the discord for more news/updates!\n-- best run on real/madium\n-- mobile soon\n-- keyless\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tropojaniexe-hub/civledz31/refs/heads/main/ledz3.3ciV\"))()","owner":{"_id":"693acdfa06da572cb7fffc63","username":"LedZLed","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/0bb5be3d0f37ce9cd8a09e3e68f48798e3195c0010f6b741839eb1051b1c06c6.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/693acdfa06da572cb7fffc63-1766067560784.jpg"},"lvl":5,"status":"offline","id":"693acdfa06da572cb7fffc63","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/0bb5be3d0f37ce9cd8a09e3e68f48798e3195c0010f6b741839eb1051b1c06c6.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/693acdfa06da572cb7fffc63-1766067560784.jpg"}},"verified":false,"discord":"https://discord.gg/dnNfNZ2xzc","keyLink":"","views":7135,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"http